# ~~ ATTENTION ~~

This file is used to track whether the container has been initialized.
Deleting, renaming, or moving this file will cause the container to be
reinitialized, which will overwrite the following files with the defaults
baked into the container (at /default-configs):

~/.bashrc
~/.bash_profile
~/.gitignore_global
~/.gitconfig
~/.tmux.conf
~/.justfile
~/.config/code-server/config.yaml

The default Code-Server config file will use the password
set in the PASSWORD environment variable when you run the container.
